        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 4045 Solid Brass Baseboard Door Bumpers -Stops</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese solid brass door stops (door bumpers) screw onto the baseboard casement or door bottom, to protect not just the door, but your door knob or lever as well.  From high-end residences to large commercial projects, Deltana is the nation\u0019s most complete provider of all of your door hardware needs.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe length is 3\"and they are available 19 great finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Baldwin 4045 Baseboard Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter:  5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 19</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
